--TEST--
a cursor still inside the receiver is writing the receiver, so the access it is in offers nothing rather than the members of the class it is standing on — `rule:ide/the-index-answers-the-cursor`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class User { public string $name; }
var $u = new User();
echo $<|>u->name;
--REQUEST--
completion
--EXPECT--
none
